##############
# Kinematics #
##############
#
# Kinematic points for which the integral should be computed
#
# - Each line should contain (in the following order)
#   * a pointname
#   * a list of numeric values for each kinematic invariant
#   * a list of numeric values for each mass
# - Kinematic invariants should be listed in the order they are defined in the mathfile
# - Masses should be listed in the order they are defined in the mathfile
#
# Example:
# pointname invariant1 invariant2 invariant3 mass1
  p1        4          -0.75      1.25       1
  p2        1.2        0.2        0.3        1